  "description": "At first glance, Rita is a completely normal young woman. What no one can tell from looking at her is that since she was a child she has been plagued by a penetrating ticking sound that seems to come directly from inside her head. The doctors are also at a loss. But when Rita has already given up hope for a cure, she meets a mysterious old witch who, of all things, gives her a watch...",
